{"parentUuid":"abe89ab9-c8f6-4570-9b64-3b6c521faa97","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011Cfsr7dZN5HMtVDQ5LsjEE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything is in place and tested. Nothing is committed yet. Say `cm` when you want the commit.\n\n**What I set up**\n\n- **`pnpm pr`** at `scripts/pr.sh`. It is the one command to open a PR. It runs these steps in a fixed order and stops at the first problem:\n  1. Fetch. Refuse on `main`, on a detached HEAD, with uncommitted changes, or when the branch's own remote copy is ahead of you.\n  2. If `origin/main` moved, merge it into your branch. It merges and does not rebase, because the post-commit hook already pushed your commits, and a rebase would need a forced push.\n  3. After a merge, run `pnpm verify` on the merged state. If it fails, the merge commit stays local and nothing is pushed.\n  4. Push. Then create the PR with `gh`. If a PR is already open for the branch, it prints that PR and does not make a second one.\n- **A merge conflict** is aborted. The tree stays clean. You resolve by hand, commit, and run `pnpm pr` again.\n- **Flags** pass through to `gh pr create`: `pnpm pr -- --draft`, `pnpm pr -- --title \"…\"`.\n- **`pnpm check:pr`** at `scripts/pr.test.sh`. It builds a temporary bare remote with two clones and stub `gh` and `pnpm` binaries. It proves seven paths: main moved, main did not move, verify fails, conflict, PR already open, each refusal, and flag pass-through. It is also in `pnpm verify:full`.\n- **Docs**: a new block in `docs/rules/03-git.md`, a row in `docs/rules/01-commands.md`, and one line in `CLAUDE.md` §3.\n- **Your global shorthand** in `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`: `pr` now means sync with remote main first, then push, then create a PR. `cmpr` is commit, then `pr`. Tell me if you want that reverted.\n\n**Verification**\n\n- `pnpm check:pr` passes, all seven cases.\n- A real run on `main` refuses with the expected message.\n- I did not run the full `pnpm verify`. No TypeScript or JavaScript changed, only shell, docs and `package.json` scripts.\n\n**Korean recap**\n\n- `pnpm pr` 하나로 PR을 엽니다. 순서: fetch → `origin/main`이 앞서 있으면 내 브랜치에 merge → merge가 있었으면 `pnpm verify` → push → `gh pr create`.\n- verify 실패 시 merge 커밋은 로컬에만 남고 push 안 됩니다. 충돌 시 merge를 abort해서 트리를 깨끗하게 둡니다. 이미 PR이 있으면 새로 만들지 않습니다.\n- rebase 대신 merge를 씁니다. post-commit 훅이 이미 커밋을 push했기 때문에 rebase는 force push가 필요해서입니다.\n- `pnpm check:pr`로 임시 remote에서 7가지 경로를 테스트합니다. 모두 통과했습니다.\n- 글로벌 단축어 `pr` / `cmpr` 뜻도 \"remote main과 먼저 동기화\"로 바꿨습니다. 원치 않으면 말씀해 주세요.\n- 아직 커밋하지 않았습니다. `cm` 하시면 커밋합니다."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":940,"cache_read_input_tokens":88935,"output_tokens":1228,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":75},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":940,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1228,"cache_read_input_tokens":88935,"cache_creation_input_tokens":940,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":940},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfsr7dJVmtt3ns2bThtxS","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-1","type":"assistant","uuid":"e678a106-24ca-42c1-b655-69279f3b2790","timestamp":"2026-10-10T03:29:27.979Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"b7a3fc04-de70-4c43-adc1-1d041c43c567","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/dev/workspace/work/bmx/bzflow2","sessionId":"b7a3fc04-de70-4c43-adc1-1d041c43c567","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main"}
